Q7. SCALE / TRUNCATION. gauntlet MAX_CODE_CHARS = 200_000 truncates the bundle and instructs
    the reviewer to answer FAIL. With diffs as bundles, what is the failure mode for a large
    but legitimate change, and what should the design do instead of a permanent unfixable FAIL?

