409-    Merging into a detached HEAD orphans the result; merging over the owner's own
410-    uncommitted work risks losing it when a failed merge is aborted.
411-    """
412-    head = subprocess.run(["git", "rev-parse", "--abbrev-ref", "HEAD"],
