The core safety path is now in place: standalone copies, stripped credentials, full-version binding, plain-text-only refusal checks, frozen review shape, and a hard stop after certification. Next I’m adding the focused proof cases, including real disposable repositories so the refusal checks exercise actual file modes and history.
